CrispCloud embedded iOS shell

CrispCloud integration code is licensed under AGPL-3.0. Third-party components retain
their own terms below. Dash COPYING explicitly identifies GPL-2.0-or-later material
in the output of mksignames.c; do not describe the entire binary as BSD-only.
Pinned Automake build helpers retain their GPL-2.0-or-later distribution exception
and X Consortium notices below; these scripts are corresponding build source.
Exact corresponding source, patches and reproducible build instructions: tool/sources.json,
patches/, tool/prepare.py and UPSTREAM.md in packages/crisp_ios_shell at
https://github.com/CrispStrobe/CrispCloud

